<title>USA: U.S. Trust Corp raises dividend 20 percent.</title>
<headline>U.S. Trust Corp raises dividend 20 percent.</headline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.60		    $0.50</p>
<p> Pay	     April 25</p>
<p> Record	  April 10</p>
<p>Note: The dividend will be paid after a two-for-one stock split set for February. The last quarterly dividend was $1.00, which translates to $0.50 per share after the split.</p>
</text>
